    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3n3djifx6fk2b",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "Gemini 4 Neon one-shots a novel RPG rulebook that is nicely laid-out and illustrated, and with a unique game mechanic...\n\n...but it is about drowned bell towers and echoes and an ancient cataclysm and strange resonances. Just like most other RPG ideas from most other models. Odd attractor, that.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3n3djifx6fk2b",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-28T01:11:54.182Z",
      "likes": 44,
      "replies": 3,
      "reposts": 4,
      "score": 6.4,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 1.7,
        "recency": 1,
        "age_hours": 2.8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3n3b6hmavpc2b",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "Ambition is being left to the AI Labs and for-profit startups. It doesn't have to be that way!",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3n3b6hmavpc2b",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-27T02:49:16.602Z",
      "likes": 68,
      "replies": 2,
      "reposts": 3,
      "score": 6.3,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 1.9,
        "recency": 0.8,
        "age_hours": 25.2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3n3dqyr6nnc2b",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "Outside of whatever is happening in cryptography, I suspect we are going to see more cases where AI progress in seemingly abstract fields has implications for vital technologies that most people did not realize are related.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3n3dqyr6nnc2b",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-28T03:26:19.026Z",
      "likes": 29,
      "replies": 1,
      "reposts": 3,
      "score": 6.1,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 1.5,
        "recency": 1,
        "age_hours": 0.6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:rrjvo5jwuateqep2i7ih5ckl/app.bsky.feed.post/3n37vadllik25",
      "handle": "cfiesler.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Casey Fiesler",
      "text": "My 73 year old father started a group chat with a happy thanksgiving message that I think includes a lot of his friends. He opened with an AI image of a turkey, and now I'm just scrolling through slop replies... \n\nAnyway ICYMI boomers have definitely discovered image generation in ChatGPT.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/cfiesler.bsky.social/post/3n37vadllik25",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-26T14:31:29.218Z",
      "likes": 57,
      "replies": 5,
      "reposts": 4,
      "score": 6,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 1.9,
        "recency": 0.8,
        "age_hours": 37.5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:rrjvo5jwuateqep2i7ih5ckl/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2ysbebic22r",
      "handle": "cfiesler.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Casey Fiesler",
      "text": "Additionally, in this course you are permitted to use AI as long as you disclose. So if this was the case for you, it is worth considering why you decided not to do so. When you do not want others to know you use AI, you could potentially learn something from some self reflection about why that is.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/cfiesler.bsky.social/post/3n2ysbebic22r",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-23T18:49:44.097Z",
      "likes": 24,
      "replies": 1,
      "reposts": 1,
      "score": 4,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 1.4,
        "recency": 0.4,
        "age_hours": 105.2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:rrjvo5jwuateqep2i7ih5ckl/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2ysej7crs2r",
      "handle": "cfiesler.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Casey Fiesler",
      "text": "And finally I explained that this was not intended as an accusation (given alternative explanations + false negatives for others in the class etc.) but rather a hopefully helpful analysis and reminder, given how aligned this is with the learning objectives of this course on AI & Society.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/cfiesler.bsky.social/post/3n2ysej7crs2r",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-23T18:51:29.932Z",
      "likes": 20,
